# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions for the latest version of Operator backpropagation (OBP)"
msgstr "Arahan pemasangan untuk versi terkini Operator backpropagation (OBP)"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions"
msgstr "Arahan pemasangan"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions {#installation-instructions}"
msgstr "Arahan pemasangan {#installation-instructions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before installing the package, choose how you’re going to run and install the packages. There are two primary ways to do this:\n"
msgstr "Sebelum memasang pakej, pilih cara anda akan menjalankan dan memasang pakej. Terdapat dua cara utama untuk melakukannya:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Option 1: Install from PyPI](#option-1)\n"
msgstr "[Pilihan 1: Pasang daripada PyPI](#option-1)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Option 2: Install from source](#option-2)\n"
msgstr "[Pilihan 2: Pasang daripada sumber](#option-2)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Preinstallation {#preinstallation}"
msgstr "Prapemasangan {#preinstallation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it. We recommend using [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3.10/tutorial/venv.html).\n"
msgstr "Pertama, cipta persekitaran minimum dengan hanya Python dipasang di dalamnya. Kami mengesyorkan penggunaan [persekitaran maya Python](https://docs.python.org/3.10/tutorial/venv.html).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "Aktifkan persekitaran baharu anda.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Note: If you are using Windows, use the following commands in PowerShell:\n"
msgstr "Nota: Jika anda menggunakan Windows, gunakan arahan berikut dalam PowerShell:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"option-1\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option 1: Install from PyPI {#option-1-install-from-pypi}"
msgstr "Pilihan 1: Pasang daripada PyPI {#option-1-install-from-pypi}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The most straightforward way to install the `qiskit-addon-obp` package is by using `PyPI`.\n"
msgstr "Cara paling mudah untuk memasang pakej `qiskit-addon-obp` ialah dengan menggunakan `PyPI`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"option-2\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option 2: Install from source {#option-2-install-from-source}"
msgstr "Pilihan 2: Pasang daripada sumber {#option-2-install-from-source}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Users who want to develop in the repository or run the notebooks locally might want to install from source.\n"
msgstr "Pengguna yang ingin membangun dalam repositori atau menjalankan notebook secara setempat mungkin ingin memasang daripada sumber.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If so, the first step is to clone the `qiskit-addon-obp` repository.\n"
msgstr "Jika ya, langkah pertama ialah mengklon repositori `qiskit-addon-obp`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, upgrade pip and enter the repository.\n"
msgstr "Seterusnya, naik taraf pip dan masuk ke dalam repositori.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The next step is to install `qiskit-addon-obp` to the virtual environment. If you plan on running the notebooks, install the notebook dependencies so you can run visualizations. If you plan on developing in the repository, you might want to install the `dev` dependencies.\n"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya ialah memasang `qiskit-addon-obp` ke dalam persekitaran maya. Jika anda bercadang untuk menjalankan notebook, pasang kebergantungan notebook supaya anda boleh menjalankan visualisasi. Jika anda bercadang untuk membangun dalam repositori, anda mungkin ingin memasang kebergantungan `dev`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust the options below to suit your needs.\n"
msgstr "Laraskan pilihan di bawah mengikut keperluan anda.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you installed the notebook dependencies, you can get started by running the notebooks in the docs directory.\n"
msgstr "Jika anda telah memasang kebergantungan notebook, anda boleh bermula dengan menjalankan notebook dalam direktori docs.\n"
